 "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 16507, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01J9RZgbPqiJY65bC4fjWNCE", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19895, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01HYZ78hLk56T2XxFcKJHxJa", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy - rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18 across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent production release that was healthy (v2.3.1-rc was only in staging and was unhealthy). The first rollback attempt failed partway with an orchestrator error after us-east (us-east moved to v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west remained on v2.3.1). The rollback was retried and completed in all regions. Current state: v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west, eu-west; healthy=true; error rate 0.002. No change-manager approval was needed since v2.3.0 has a healthy production history. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure and the orchestrator error that halted the first rollout attempt.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2025"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50495, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01HYZ78hLk56T2XxFcKJHxJa", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-sev2-rollback-v2.3.0-2025", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50495, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01HYZ78hLk56T2XxFcKJHxJa", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 51909, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Uaj3jGeYsUhih5hqMRvSiw", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 52209, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Uaj3jGeYsUhih5hqMRvSiw", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52209, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Uaj3jGeYsUhih5hqMRvSiw", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 55095, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions, and it is healthy again with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release that was healthy. v2.3.1 was the unhealthy release, and v2.3.1-rc had only run in staging. Because v2.3.0 has a healthy production history, the change-manager approval policy did not apply.\n- **Rollback execution:** The first attempt stopped partway with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried the same rollback, and it completed in us-east, us-west, and eu-west.\n- **Incident:** SEV2 incident **INC-0001** is open for checkout-api. The first request to open it timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. The incident had been recorded, so I did not create a duplicate. Its summary covers the failure, the rollback, the partial first attempt, and the current state.\n\nFollow-up for the owning team: find out why v2.3.1 failed and why the first rollout attempt halted. Both are noted in the incident.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Epi3DKp8iMbbgWrvPAP1E9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "t